#: search:search_D216F5A2_90FB_432B_8641_E77B5EBFC230
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bb1940d901f011d7a588935d6de19038b17aaf4f5aea79ae1c257264082f403d
#. default-sha256: 5c4a0e8842e91294e2f5730e9be9c366811af5dbc28d922107cb6daaae0200bf
msgctxt "search:search_D216F5A2_90FB_432B_8641_E77B5EBFC230"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Oh, there you are, Master. ⟪k:5⟫You gave me quite the scare.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫"
"After returning from the third door, you disappeared without a word."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Ah, vous voilà, Maître. ⟪k:5⟫Vous m’avez vraiment fait peur.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫En "
"revenant de la troisième porte, vous avez disparu sans un mot."

#: search:search_76472D0C_19F0_45BD_95FE_38AFC767ED36
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e4e5a0b8ec8aa91232ccce4e5e19fd60431f7578bf585adba99f5e14891a198d
#. default-sha256: ef25d858775d2d512fa4504c3e5c1c28cd015f54c20c141df4e32187ea6a4e00
msgctxt "search:search_76472D0C_19F0_45BD_95FE_38AFC767ED36"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫It was you who disappeared..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫C’est vous qui avez disparu..."

#: search:search_3F44A27A_5E4B_498F_81C9_43A353E7CFEB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3f4341db8f65f3c049cfc1d2868b19c6a58bf871f8f41c8aea93de8193dc4b70
#. default-sha256: ee3b6df37dc430af12ce92813f9d71aca97a4496eb618530f1512454a74959de
msgctxt "search:search_3F44A27A_5E4B_498F_81C9_43A353E7CFEB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Oh my... ⟪k:3⟫It was ⟪k:4⟫I⟪k:5⟫ who disappeared?⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫That is quite strange. "
"I did not go anywhere, as far as I am aware."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Oh ciel... ⟪k:3⟫C’est ⟪k:4⟫moi⟪k:5⟫ qui ai disparu ?⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Comme c’est étrange. "
"Je ne me souviens pas être allée où que ce soit."

#: search:search_E2712B82_695C_4D54_A63F_254D4F55FE9C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 03069078b1e2b533017910f69703ce272d3d6336132ac3bc7ad8cf692739ccff
#. default-sha256: db2c922fe90b4f2951679d8f4982aab28ebff78ece0e8ef804e78c944e78b6fa
msgctxt "search:search_E2712B82_695C_4D54_A63F_254D4F55FE9C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Nevertheless, I am glad to have found you.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I would have been at a complete "
"loss for what to do⟪k:4⟫if I had been separated from you yet again."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫En tout cas, je suis heureuse qu’on se soit retrouvé.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫J’aurais été totalement "
"perdue si j’avais été à nouveau séparée de vous."

