msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫À⟪k:5⟫ nouveau... ?"

#: search:search_913C6C5B_DE65_459D_8148_136B8DAAABE2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4bd7a24bb11b973d2ae010e7e50db85474ee2d15c338544a9101abca1cf61388
