msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Vous avez dit... ⟪k:1⟫que vous m’attendiez..."

#: search:search_B320244E_8E13_4AA2_8770_DAFE48335C47
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f6fc1a8750198b19950bebb4ce3f1942ae3194534998fee6d6f0c6008b42d593
