msgctxt "search:search_B320244E_8E13_4AA2_8770_DAFE48335C47"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I did, indeed, say that when you first arrived.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I have been waiting for "
"your return for a very long time."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Oui, c’est bien ce que j’ai dit à votre arrivée.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫J’attendais votre retour "
"depuis très longtemps."

#: search:search_3559D7AC_CF00_3609_7196_1CA18989ADC0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 853c02afbb10c78f4dce250e471dded5a17c6305b50a3c38a5d8b6f1fc3bc6b7
