#: search:search_E72785FD_5854_43DD_B8DA_45D0F2A1512F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a67469506f8f2d4af9bca7ad4200dd6a536c11f56fefff075ccd3966e8087733
